      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>scale the \"kindness and respect\" stuff for me... it's not working. i can't go to the grocery store without someone staring or whispering. i see the looks. it's like they're all looking at a monster. even when i'm alone, the noise in my head just repeats what they said. everything i worked for, everything i was... it's just gone. there's no coming back from this. the person i used to be is just extinct.",
